  "description": "The Zircus is the perfect tool for mastering pumptrack skills, learning bunnyhops, manuals, 180’s and other moves that are all in the ABC of mountain bike riding! The Zircus has the same lightweight and strong aluminum frame that is used in the Movement range and is built using affordable but high-quality parts making this bike perfect for playing in the city, off-road or on pump tracks. The bike has a compact drivetrain that saves weight and gives it that ‘pro’ look. An optional derailleur hanger is available so you can convert this bike from single speed to gears if needed.\nMAIN FEATURES\n- Tough and light alloy frame BASED ON DECADE\n- “Pro dirt” geometry\n- RST dirt t 100mm\n- Tektro ARIES rear disc brake\n- strong rear hub with 10t driver\n- NS Bikes cockpit\n- microdrive drivetrain with small chainring\nPOWERFUL BRAKES\nTektro MD-M300 Ariesa rear disc brake\nTOUGH AND LIGHT ALLOY FRAME\n\"Pro Dirt\" geometry.\nNS BIKES COMPONENTS\nNS Bikes and Octane One aftermarket components in unique finishes.",
